# Declining the optional Forest still uses the activation; the sorcery restriction forbids combat, while sacrificing Gaea's Touch makes two green mana immediately (CR 602.5d, 605.3b).
[Bot1 Deck]
Gaea's Touch
Mox Emerald
Gleemox
Forest x22
[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x25
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Gleemox.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Gleemox.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Gaea's Touch.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Gaea's Touch.Activate(Ability: {0})
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose()
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 3
! Bot1.Battlefield.Gaea's Touch.Activate(Ability: {0})
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Gaea's Touch.Activate(Ability: {0})
Bot1.Battlefield.Gaea's Touch.Activate(Ability: Sacrifice)
? Bot1.Mana = {G}{G}
[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Gaea's Touch
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 2
